  <item>
    <title>给孩子和成人的性教育</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6745c9a78d1233fb0d3f7f46</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6745c9a78d1233fb0d3f7f46</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 27 Nov 2024 21:36:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>不好意思，又又迟到了。傻白大病了两次拖慢了更新进度，努力上传节目中。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期从傻白10月读过的书《</span><a href="http://www.sssch.net/Admin/ckfinder/userfiles/files/xinlizixun/yueduliaofa2/shu/%E4%BB%8E%E5%B0%BF%E5%B8%83%E5%88%B0%E7%BA%A6%E4%BC%9A%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%B6%E9%95%BF%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E4%B9%8B%E5%85%BB%E8%82%B2%E6%80%A7%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7%E7%9A%84%E5%84%BF%E7%AB%A5%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%8E%E5%A9%B4%E5%84%BF%E6%9C%9F%E5%88%B0%E5%88%9D%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%89%E3%80%8B%20(%E3%80%90%E7%BE%8E%E3%80%91%E9%BB%9B%E5%B8%83%E6%8B%89%20%C2%B7W%EF%BC%8E%E5%93%88%E5%A4%AB%E7%BA%B3)%20(z-lib_org).pdf" data-url="http://www.sssch.net/Admin/ckfinder/userfiles/files/xinlizixun/yueduliaofa2/shu/%E4%BB%8E%E5%B0%BF%E5%B8%83%E5%88%B0%E7%BA%A6%E4%BC%9A%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%B6%E9%95%BF%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E4%B9%8B%E5%85%BB%E8%82%B2%E6%80%A7%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7%E7%9A%84%E5%84%BF%E7%AB%A5%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%8E%E5%A9%B4%E5%84%BF%E6%9C%9F%E5%88%B0%E5%88%9D%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%89%E3%80%8B%20(%E3%80%90%E7%BE%8E%E3%80%91%E9%BB%9B%E5%B8%83%E6%8B%89%20%C2%B7W%EF%BC%8E%E5%93%88%E5%A4%AB%E7%BA%B3)%20(z-lib_org).pdf"><span>从尿布到约会：家长指南之养育S健康的儿童</span></a><span>》得到启示，想探讨什么是S？为什么S带来愉悦？我们的大脑怎么处理和控制。S教育和所有学习一样都是终身的！所以你准备好了吗？也许你不一定会成为父母，但是请你像爱你孩子一样爱你自己，并坦率真诚地交流“S”吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们下周三（flag先立好）节目会讨论这几年拿铁和傻白都非常感兴趣地话题：</span><strong><span>怎样逆转衰老？</span></strong><span>尽情期待。</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>听友群请wx+ aintnocappuccino</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>下面是本期地shownotes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="266">4:26</a> 一场给全年龄段的教育</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="473">7:53</a> 我们会被对方的第二特征唤醒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">9:50</a> 温柔的触摸也会让我们快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1005">16:45</a> 杏仁核帮我们决定是否要唤醒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1257">20:57</a> 人类强大的“幻像”技能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1304">21:44</a> 唤醒和渴望的差别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1391">23:11</a> 男女s high 超的差别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1845">30:45</a> 羞于谈s和公开的教育</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2153">35:53</a> 为什么我们要开诚布公地谈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2239">37:19</a> 人类最早的发展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2295">38:15</a> 为什么不要给 升值奇观（已经不知道怎么改了）取nick name</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2516">41:56</a> 教导孩子怎样识别和避免可能的s 琴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2763">46:03</a> 对于儿童主动的态度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3149">52:29</a> 青春期的自我成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3508">58:28</a> 知识点自查</span></p>]]></description>
