  <item>
    <title>无痛瘦身、健康饮食、快乐生活的要义就在这句话</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f71a4c81cdab3a93941e6f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f71a4c81cdab3a93941e6f</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 27 Sep 2024 20:49:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>控糖那期没有聊完的话题，我们在这里继续聊（也可以入群和我们一起聊，请wx+ &nbsp;aintnocappuccino）：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">1:00</a> 无痛瘦身的“无痛”秘诀就是吃对食物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">2:08</a> 本期推荐的两本书：《我，包罗万象》by </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/author/4617876" data-url="https://book.douban.com/author/4617876"><span>埃德·扬</span></a><a href="https://book.douban.com/author/4617876" data-url="https://book.douban.com/author/4617876"><span>；</span></a><span> 《饮食的迷思》by</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/search/%E8%92%82%E5%A7%86%C2%B7%E6%96%AF%E4%BD%A9%E5%85%8B%E7%89%B9" data-url="https://book.douban.com/search/%E8%92%82%E5%A7%86%C2%B7%E6%96%AF%E4%BD%A9%E5%85%8B%E7%89%B9"><span>蒂姆·斯佩克特</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">5:20</a> 所有的饮食研究和指导都不必太在意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a> 计算食物热量也是完全没有必要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="827">13:47</a> </span><strong><span>选择吃的第一原则：食物是否可以增加肠道菌群多样性</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="995">16:35</a> 微生物帮助“人”成为人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1518">25:18</a> 微生物和人类的免疫系统</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1762">29:22</a> 胃是人的第二个大脑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2502">41:42</a> 饮食多样性增进了肠道菌群多样性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2651">44:11</a> 食品添加剂的危害</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2791">46:31</a> 尽量避免深加工食物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3009">50:09</a> 最让拿铁关注的食物：巧克力和咖啡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3329">55:29</a> 非深加工奶制品，非常推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3509">58:29</a> 过敏和哮喘这些时代病</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群：请加 aintnocappuccino，聊聊你的看法!</span></p>]]></description>
