    <title>060 30+的学姐教你规划（不）完美的大学求学生涯</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66894d5aae8e21859af8177e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66894d5aae8e21859af8177e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jul 2024 13:57:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期留言区题目】你的大学生活有哪些遗憾？</span></p><span></span><p><span>来给我们留言吧！爱看留言！多多益善！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="27">00:27</a> 聊这个话题的起源：接到一个妹妹的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 每个人的20多岁都很惶恐，我们也是</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="313">05:13</a> 高考对我们的人生做出哪些改变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a> 高考后的暑假如果只能做一件事，我们推荐这一件！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1089">18:09</a> 如何规划大学生活？太多todo-list反而让人更焦虑！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1535">25:35</a> 学习应该在大学生活占到什么位置</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1781">29:41</a> 只考上三本也能去世界TOP 5学校！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1994">33:14</a> 一定要认真学习！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2026">33:46</a> 如何以读书为契机培养工作所需的学习能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2113">35:13</a> 学的东西一定会用到？请放弃这种期待！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2266">37:46</a> 不怎么读书但绩点还不错？傻白的“克服信息差”技巧大分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 如何找到有意思又赚得多的实习？傻白的高级打工人技巧大分享！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> 要不要出国？怎么确定自己适合出国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> 出国要做的心理准备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3423">57:03</a> 对于校园恋爱拿铁大声疾呼：不要怕当渣女</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3498">58:18</a> 勇敢去恋爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3683">01:01:23</a> 傻白小课堂预告：怎么追到喜欢的男生（真的会有人听吗？）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3780">01:03:00</a> 如何通过读书了解自己？拿铁和傻白的不同答案</span></p>]]></description>
